  <name>Hanuchi</name>
  <summary>Minimalist GTK4 frontend for LogMeIn Hamachi</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Hanuchi is a lightweight, utility-first GUI for managing LogMeIn Hamachi
      networks on Linux. Designed for modern GNOME environments, it controls
      the logmein-hamachi service via PolicyKit and lets you join, create,
      leave and inspect networks.
    </p>
  </description>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">hanuchi.desktop</launchable>
  <url type="homepage">https://github.com/Advnirr/hanuchi</url>
